In the **Description** field, write a more detailed template. You can use `if`/`else` logic to provide context-specific instructions:

```
{{ if (gt $values.A.Value 90.0) -}}
CRITICAL: Immediate action required for {{ $labels.instance }}.
{{ else -}}
WARNING: {{ $labels.instance }} is approaching threshold.
{{- end }}
Current value: {{ $values.A.Value }}
```

The `{{-` and `-}}` syntax trims whitespace around the output.
